  "label": "Foreigner is mapped onto the man",
  "description": "The text 'gay guys never get messages from foreigners' implies that foreigners are the ones sending messages, and the image of the man wearing a kufi is used to visually represent the 'foreigner' in this context. This creates an analogical mapping where the man (visual entity) is mapped onto the concept of 'foreigner' (textual entity).",
